# Before: finite set literals retained checked child and pairwise WD evidence,
# but the target constructor did not consume the exact indexed matrix.
# Now: `Litex.listSet` receives source-ordered children and every pair proof.
# Boundary: missing, duplicated, reversed, or retargeted pair roles fail closed.
# Evidence: focused Rust and ignored real-Mathlib gates are recorded in the ledger.

forall a, b set:
    a != b
    =>:
        {a, b} = {a, b}

forall a, b, c set:
    a != b
    a != c
    b != c
    =>:
        {a, b, c} = {a, b, c}
